Package: gof5
Architecture: any
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Open Source F5 BIG-IP VPN client
 gof5 is a client for F5 BIG-IP SSL VPN networks (formerly known as
 FirePass). It establishes a PPP tunnel over SSL, supporting both
 DTLS and TLS tunnels, and takes care of routes, DNS resolvers and
 the VPN tunnel interface. On Linux it integrates with
 systemd-resolved and NetworkManager, and can run unprivileged when
 the binary is given the appropriate capabilities.
